# One symbol per line, sorted. Regenerate with
# `make update_abi_baseline` and commit the result whenever the
# public API gains a symbol. Removing a line from this file, or
# changing an existing symbol's signature, breaks every
# application already linked against this ABI version and
# requires incrementing VERSION_MAJOR in the root Makefile.
